# ============================================================
# Apple Intelligence / iOS Writing Tools / ChatGPT Extension
# Loon Remote Rule (.lsr) — choose an overseas policy in Loon
# This file intentionally has NO policy column: policy is assigned
# by Loon's [Remote Rule] subscription.
#
# Reference: https://support.apple.com/101555
# Apple AI relay traffic may use TCP/UDP 443. Do not MITM it.
# ============================================================

# Apple Intelligence / Private Cloud Compute (Apple documented)
DOMAIN,apple-relay.apple.com
DOMAIN,apple-relay.cloudflare.com
DOMAIN,apple-relay.fastly-edge.com
DOMAIN,cp4.cloudflare.com

# Siri / search (Apple documented; may also affect related services)
DOMAIN,guzzoni.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,smoot.apple.com

# Related Apple Intelligence / Siri endpoints (community reported)
DOMAIN,gspe1-ssl.ls.apple.com
DOMAIN,apple-relay.akamaized.net
DOMAIN,apple-relay.mask.apple-dns.net

# ChatGPT extension sign-in and network requests
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,openai.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,chatgpt.com
